# The Lantern Below: a showcase of round 18's cartoon features under the sea (docs/VIDEO_GENERATION.md, "Under the sea, round 18"). Marina the mermaid, Pip in his glass bubble sub,
# a pufferfish who will not leave a hook alone, a ride on a fast lane to a town under the sea as night falls, and something very big in the dark beyond it.
# Heights on the sea's lines are above the seabed (15 m down: no terrain); a character's y and the camera's keys are the world's (the surface at 0).
film    the-lantern-below
name    The Lantern Below
about   Marina the mermaid and Pip in his bubble sub race a fast lane to the town under the sea for the lantern night - and meet what lives in the dark beyond it.
scene   film_assets/wild/set.pbrt
length  70
tags    cartoon, underwater, showcase

toon       bands 3  lines 2
water      sea  level 0  waves 0.35
sky        16:30 23:00 south 0 physical
underwater clarity 2  colour teal
exposure   auto 0.6
current    0.06 toward 70

# the reef where it starts, and the boat over it
reef       24 in -8 -16 8 -9
shells     50 in -6 -10 6 -3
boat       rowboat dinghy at 1 -7 facing 80
hook       0.6 -6.6 at -20 depth 2.2 yank 13.5
drawnrays  count 8 bright 1.2

character  marina mermaid at -5 -13.5 -6  facing 90  hair red tail teal
character  puff   puffer  at 0.9 -13.3 -5.2  facing 15
character  hip    seahorse at -1.8 -13.4 -4.4  facing 140  scale 1.5
character  pip    pip     at 14 -12.4 -9  facing 270
walk       marina 0.5 0.9  -1.2 -6.2
gesture    marina "wave" 2.6 3 4.4 4.8
say        marina 2.8 "Afternoon, Hip!"
gesture    hip    "nod" 3.6 3.8 4.6 4.8
gesture    puff   "puff" 9.2 9.5 12.5 13
gulp       puff   at 8.6
say        marina 10 "Puff! Leave that hook alone!"
feel       puff   scared 8.5 8.8 13 13.5

# Pip arrives in his bubble sub, and they race along the fast lane to town
sub        bubble orb at 14 3 -9 to 3 3 -7.5 speed 1.2 from 13 rise 30
aboard     pip orb
say        pip 22 "Race you to the lantern night!"
gesture    marina "cheer" 23 23.4 24.6 25
fastlane   eac at 0 3 -6 to 30 3.5 -10 to 60 3 -14 width 4 speed 3.2 turtles 4
ride       marina eac from 25 to 34
speedlines marina during 25 35
sub        round nemo at 18 3.5 -16 to 34 4 -6 to 58 3.5 -10 speed 2.6 from 25 dive 26
# the town under the sea, as night falls
seatown    80 -14 radius 14 houses 11 lamps 10 traffic 50
school     sardines 260 at 80 7 -6 radius 3
schoolshow 1 heart at 42 for 8 size 4 toward 0 centre 80 9 -22
choir      1 at 41 for 9
schoolshow 1 word NIGHT! at 62 for 7 size 2.2 toward 0 centre 80 8 -22
seasparkle amount 1.2
# what is out in the dark beyond it
hugeeye    96 3 -26 toward 300 size 2.4 open 51
kraken     104 2 -38 size 6 toward 300 rise 46 reach 86 4 -20 from 56 glow 54
reveal     104 9 -44 at 53 bright 1.5 colour 0.5 0.7 1.0 over 3
bubblewipe at 60.5
blowring   marina at 66
whalesong  at 48 for 20

shot 0 The reef
  key   -1.4 -12.9 -1.6   -0.9 -13.1 -6.0   46
  key   -1.0 -13.0 -2.2   -0.6 -13.1 -6.0   42
shot 7.5 The hook
  key   1.6 -13.0 -3.4   0.7 -13.1 -6.2   38
shot 14 Pip
  key   2.0 -12.4 -1.0   6.0 -12.6 -8.0   50
shot 24 The fast lane
  follow marina  behind 4.5  up 1.2  side 1.5  fov 52
shot 36 Town
  key   80 -6 6   80 -12.5 -14   60
  key   81 -6.5 5  80 -11.5 -16   56
shot 47 The dark
  key   76 -11.5 -9  96 -11 -26   50
shot 55 Grandpa Kraken
  key   78 -10 -8   102 -9.5 -36   58
shot 60.5 Lantern night
  key   80 -9 4   80 -7.5 -20   56
